<title>UK: Bouygues sets 1.5 bln FRF domestic bond.</title>
<headline>Bouygues sets 1.5 bln FRF domestic bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following seven-year domestic bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque Nationale de Paris and Credit Lyonnais.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BOUYGUES</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN FRF   COUPON     5.75 PCT  MATURITY    06.JAN.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.18    PAY DATE    06.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.70 PCT  REOFFER    99.83     SPREAD	+47 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    PARIS     PAY FREQ   ANNUAL DENOMS (K)  FIVE</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.90	SELL CONC  0.80</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.75 PCT 2003 OAT / 8.25 PCT 2004 OAT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
